#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: pnscripts-price-history.php
msgid "PN Scripts Price History for Discounts"
msgstr "PN Scripts Price History für Rabattaktionen"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: pnscripts-price-history.php
msgid "https://pnscripts.com/marketplace/pnscripts-price-history"
msgstr "https://pnscripts.com/marketplace/pnscripts-price-history"

#. Description of the plugin
#: pnscripts-price-history.php
msgid ""
"Records every product and variation price change and shows the lowest price "
"in the 30 days before a discount (EU Price Indication Directive, Art. 6a). "
"Shows nothing when the history is incomplete."
msgstr ""
"Speichert jede Preisänderung von Produkten und Varianten und zeigt den "
"niedrigsten Preis der 30 Tage vor einer Preisermäßigung "
"(Preisangabenrichtlinie, Art. 6a). Zeigt nichts an, wenn die Preishistorie "
"unvollständig ist."

#. Author of the plugin
#: pnscripts-price-history.php
msgid "PN Scripts"
msgstr "PN Scripts"

